<section class="border-b border-border bg-card"><div class="container-page py-14 sm:py-20"><div class="mb-8"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-muted-foreground"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-current="page" class="text-foreground">About</span></li></ol></nav></div><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>About us</p><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl leading-[1.08] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">We built the measurement layer that pet care was missing</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">PawlogicTech is an engineering company with a veterinary conscience. Every model we ship is governed by clinicians, and every threshold is tuned for usefulness rather than engagement.</p></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-center"><div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Our story</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">It started with a diagnosis that came too late</h2></div><p>In 2019, a nine-year-old spaniel was diagnosed with advanced mitral valve disease. Reviewing the case afterwards, the clinical picture was unambiguous: the animal's resting heart rate had almost certainly been rising for months, and their exercise tolerance had been quietly declining for longer than that. Nobody had been measuring either.</p><p>That case brought together a veterinary surgeon frustrated by the limits of annual consultations and two engineers who had spent their careers extracting weak signals from noisy biomedical data. The premise was simple. If we could measure continuously and compare against an individual baseline, we could move detection forward by weeks.</p><p>Seven years later that premise has held. Across 128,000+ monitored animals, our trend alerts typically precede owner-reported symptoms by nine to twenty-one days.</p></div><img alt="Cat resting at home beside a PawlogicTech monitoring sensor" class="w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-lift" decoding="async" height="900" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() ); ?>/assets/images/cat-monitoring.webp" width="1200"/></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Milestones</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">How the company developed</h2></div><ol class="mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border bg-border md:grid-cols-5"><li class="bg-card p-7"><p class="font-display text-3xl text-accent">2019</p><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Founded in London by a veterinary surgeon and two signal-processing engineers after a preventable late-stage cardiac diagnosis.</p></li><li class="bg-card p-7"><p class="font-display text-3xl text-accent">2021</p><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">First continuous monitoring platform released following an eighteen-month clinical validation study with partner practices.</p></li><li class="bg-card p-7"><p class="font-display text-3xl text-accent">2023</p><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Behaviour analysis launched with on-device audio classification, a deliberate architectural choice made for privacy.</p></li><li class="bg-card p-7"><p class="font-display text-3xl text-accent">2025</p><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Safety and smart care platforms unified into a single connected record across all five service areas.</p></li><li class="bg-card p-7"><p class="font-display text-3xl text-accent">2026</p><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Over 128,000 animals monitored across the UK, Ireland and mainland Europe.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Principles</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">The commitments that shape every product decision</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">These frequently make the product harder to build. We keep them anyway.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Veterinary-governed</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Every alert threshold is reviewed by our veterinary advisory panel before it ships. Nothing is tuned purely for engagement.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Individual baselines</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We compare your animal to itself, not to a breed average. That is the difference between a useful alert and a false alarm.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Privacy without compromise</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Audio is classified on-device. Data is encrypted end to end and never sold to insurers, brokers or advertisers.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Reward-based only</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We refuse to build, sell or integrate with aversive correction hardware. Our training platform is positive reinforcement, always.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">One connected record</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Health, behaviour, nutrition and safety in a single record, because correlation is where the insight lives.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Built to be handed over</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Everything exports. Your data belongs to you and follows your animal across clinics and countries.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-secondary"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>The team</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Clinicians and engineers, in equal measure</h2></div><ul class="mt-12 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="rounded-3xl border border-sage-foreground/10 bg-card p-8"><h3 class="text-xl">Dr. Amelia Hart BVSc MRCVS</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Co-founder &amp; Veterinary Lead</p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Twelve years in first-opinion and emergency practice before co-founding PawlogicTech. Chairs our veterinary advisory panel and signs off every clinical threshold we ship.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-sage-foreground/10 bg-card p-8"><h3 class="text-xl">Jonas Bergstrom</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Co-founder &amp; Chief Technology Officer</p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Former biomedical signal-processing engineer. Designed the sensor fusion architecture behind per-animal baseline modelling.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-sage-foreground/10 bg-card p-8"><h3 class="text-xl">Marcus Feld CCAB</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Head of Behavioural Science</p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Certified clinical animal behaviourist. Leads behavioural model design and the company's reward-based-only policy.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-sage-foreground/10 bg-card p-8"><h3 class="text-xl">Ines Duarte</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Head of Product Design</p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Responsible for making complex physiological data legible to owners at seven in the morning, which is harder than it sounds.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-primary text-primary-foreground"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2"><div><p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Governance</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">How clinical oversight actually works here</h2></div><div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75"><p>Our veterinary advisory panel includes first-opinion practitioners, a cardiology specialist and a certified clinical animal behaviourist. No alert threshold reaches production without panel sign-off, and any threshold change is re-reviewed.</p><p>We publish the reasoning behind every alert type in our product documentation, including what triggers it and what it explicitly does not mean. Clinicians should never be asked to trust a number they cannot interrogate.</p><p>We also maintain a firm boundary. PawlogicTech monitors, measures and triages. Diagnosis and treatment belong to a qualified veterinary professional, and our alerts direct owners towards that care rather than away from it.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="border-t-2 border-accent pt-5"><p class="font-display text-4xl">128,000+</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Pets actively monitored</p></div><div class="border-t-2 border-accent pt-5"><p class="font-display text-4xl">9–21 days</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Typical early-warning lead time</p></div><div class="border-t-2 border-accent pt-5"><p class="font-display text-4xl">42</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Veterinary partner practices</p></div><div class="border-t-2 border-accent pt-5"><p class="font-display text-4xl">99.95%</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Platform uptime, trailing 12 months</p></div></div><p class="mt-10 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Interested in the clinical validation work behind these figures? <a class="font-semibold text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/contact/' ) ); ?>">Contact our veterinary team</a> and we will share the methodology.</p></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-primary px-8 py-16 text-primary-foreground sm:px-14"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-accent/25 blur-3xl"></span><div class="relative max-w-2xl"><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Work with a company that will tell you when you do not need us</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">We would rather have a smaller customer who trusts the product than a larger one who ignores the alerts.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/contact/' ) ); ?>">Book a consultation</a><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary-foreground/30 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors hover:border-primary-foreground" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/' ) ); ?>">Explore services</a></div></div></div></div></section><script>(function(a,f){let l;try{l=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(a)||"{}")}catch{return}const n=l?.[f||history.state?.__TSR_key];let c=!1;for(const t in n){const e=n[t],o=e?.scrollX,s=e?.scrollY;if(Number.isFinite(o)&&Number.isFinite(s)){if(t==="window")scrollTo(o,s),c=!0;else if(t)try{const r=document.querySelector(t);r&&(r.scrollLeft=o,r.scrollTop=s)}catch{}}}if(c)return;const i=location.hash.slice(1);if(i){const t=history.state?.__hashScrollIntoViewOptions??!0;if(t){const e=document.getElementById(i);e&&e.scrollIntoView(t)}return}scrollTo(0,0)})("tsr-scroll-restoration-v1_3");document.currentScript.remove()</script>
